{"1287540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dino Hazard: Chronos Blackout", "steam_appid": 1287540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [1545950], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">🦖 <strong>Dino Hazard: Chronos Blackout</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A time-travel dinosaur JRPG — created by real paleontologists.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a mysterious blackout, a high-tech island spirals into chaos: prehistoric creatures are unleashed, rogue AIs take control, and shadowy corporations pull the strings.<br>Lead a diverse team of survivors, face moral choices of <strong>HATE or LOVE</strong>, and decide the fate of Chronos Island.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✨ <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>90s-inspired JRPG</strong> — blending the spirit of <i>Chrono Trigger, Phantasy Star, Undertale,</i> and <i>Dino Crisis</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🦕 <strong>Scientifically accurate dinosaurs</strong> — reconstructed with real paleontology consulting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👥 <strong>7 playable characters</strong> — each with unique abilities, styles, and backstories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 <strong>Moral choices of HATE or LOVE</strong> — influence the world around you and unlock multiple endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 <strong>A living island to explore</strong> — distinct ecosystems, hidden secrets, and futuristic facilities to restore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏱️ <strong>Long playtime</strong> —</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main story: 30+ hours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story + side quests: 50+ hours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completionist (Dinodex, secrets, endings): 90+ hours</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎶 <strong>Original soundtrack</strong> — nostalgic and epic, also available in the Deluxe bundle.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📢 <strong>What the media says</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“Undertale, Jurassic Park and Phantasy Star collide in a time-traveling dinosaur JRPG.”</i> — <strong>GamesRadar</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“A remarkable RPG. Beautiful art, amazing music, and an emotional story.”</i> — <strong>Grinding Cast</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“It feels nostalgic yet fresh. If you love dinosaurs, this game is perfect for you.”</i> — <strong>IGN</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💡 <strong>Real-world impact</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Part of the profits from <i>Dino Hazard</i> go directly into <strong>scientific research in paleontology</strong>, supporting studies on real dinosaur fossils.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👉 <strong>Choose your path. Restore the future. Survive the blackout.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">🦖 <strong>Dino Hazard: Chronos Blackout</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A time-travel dinosaur JRPG — created by real paleontologists.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a mysterious blackout, a high-tech island spirals into chaos: prehistoric creatures are unleashed, rogue AIs take control, and shadowy corporations pull the strings.<br>Lead a diverse team of survivors, face moral choices of <strong>HATE or LOVE</strong>, and decide the fate of Chronos Island.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✨ <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>90s-inspired JRPG</strong> — blending the spirit of <i>Chrono Trigger, Phantasy Star, Undertale,</i> and <i>Dino Crisis</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🦕 <strong>Scientifically accurate dinosaurs</strong> — reconstructed with real paleontology consulting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👥 <strong>7 playable characters</strong> — each with unique abilities, styles, and backstories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 <strong>Moral choices of HATE or LOVE</strong> — influence the world around you and unlock multiple endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 <strong>A living island to explore</strong> — distinct ecosystems, hidden secrets, and futuristic facilities to restore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏱️ <strong>Long playtime</strong> —</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main story: 30+ hours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story + side quests: 50+ hours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completionist (Dinodex, secrets, endings): 90+ hours</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎶 <strong>Original soundtrack</strong> — nostalgic and epic, also available in the Deluxe bundle.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📢 <strong>What the media says</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“Undertale, Jurassic Park and Phantasy Star collide in a time-traveling dinosaur JRPG.”</i> — <strong>GamesRadar</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“A remarkable RPG. Beautiful art, amazing music, and an emotional story.”</i> — <strong>Grinding Cast</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“It feels nostalgic yet fresh. If you love dinosaurs, this game is perfect for you.”</i> — <strong>IGN</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💡 <strong>Real-world impact</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Part of the profits from <i>Dino Hazard</i> go directly into <strong>scientific research in paleontology</strong>, supporting studies on real dinosaur fossils.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👉 <strong>Choose your path. Restore the future. Survive the blackout.</strong></p>", "short_description": "A story-rich JRPG set in a dystopian future where you befriend dinosaur companions, face tough choices with heart and humor, and unlock multiple endings.", "supported_languages": "English, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Spanish - Spain, French, German, Russian, Itali